    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good in theory, but what if they bring up the legal challenge? I've seen rumors that our main data processing patent is being contested in court right now. If they ask if there's any ongoing litigation or risk to our IP, how do I handle that without killing the deal?",
